      "body": "## [4.38.2](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/compare/v4.38.1...v4.38.2) (2026-10-28)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **build:** align catalog and tool fixtures ([68b4dca](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/68b4dca9fe3c335c6ac7c913c2926521677d94b9))\n* **build:** select Aspire 13.6.4 for the catalog and G-6 tuple ([1745ea0](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/1745ea0f09df9e518aeea3eeb1a7df836f67e09d))\n* **ci:** accept the package mapping mode string ([b15dab4](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/b15dab4cc740b6fb2d2065682f76b8166a7e120a))\n* **ci:** align Aspire SDK exception inventory ([4250edc](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/4250edc94af021945fe072085f02b5122c9b21c3))\n* **ci:** refresh audit after package updates ([3d7f49a](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/3d7f49a5430294da5bcd437cbdace85c62c42027))\n* **ci:** trust development HTTPS certificates for Aspire tests ([9f85d8e](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/9f85d8e66e5c16675cee8c224f1fd88430d96007))\n* **deps:** consume published EventStore 3.128.4 ([fd28b13](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/fd28b13416f44d62311dde9bf5920ccf170df0d6))\n* **deps:** consume the published native Folders client ([a53cbcd](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/a53cbcdb1dca529ebc1102e4a490dbdc26880bd4))\n* package versions ([30455c2](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/30455c2fbbc2a93a82fccd4255b7cd3520f20a46))\n* package versions ([db35ee0](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/db35ee0a27c9b44fead973bf60c6d08abf61ca6b))\n* **tooling:** align fixtures with EventStore 3.128.4 ([2574bf2](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/2574bf2f3da5367d8801f0d7661d66155e5d90b0))\n"
