      "body": "# [4.38.0](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/compare/v4.37.0...v4.38.0) (2026-10-25)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* **module:** qualify corrected CLI release source ([36e7e48](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/36e7e4852ea15f54e8299d57607335c8f5435b73))\n* **module:** qualify corrected CLI release source ([219d48a](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/219d48a3baba27ba3ec7a1c457b0667dc825d195))\n* **module:** release corrected configuration keys ([c81e691](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/c81e691f5cb3be7590c99a3bfc1518d2d899fd6c))\n* **release:** allow new nuget package version floors ([d9070aa](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/d9070aa0d43feb9e3359286bc797d2be65960727))\n* **runtime:** refuse Dapr configuration names that are not plain scalars ([fa6aeda](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/fa6aedaa1603557730833f1d8ff8ae79838499b2))\n* **runtime:** remove pre-start state after an unmapped project refusal ([68e65f2](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/68e65f2023eca117a2aa08a022ee33d8f4c34a44))\n* **testing:** harden run-owned suite provisioning ([ba5e371](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/ba5e371472c832261ae2c3f6f99c1928b6cac780))\n* **tooling:** align the schema, G-4 default and fixtures with EventStore 3.127.0 ([8c9caa7](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/8c9caa77feb85a2dce03153519d81684128890a6))\n* **tooling:** complete story 2.4 run-owned suite provisioning ([37d98f6](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/37d98f6b97910ce5b00b505e44c1c531a1657b65))\n* **tooling:** harden local run outcome retention and cleanup ([0ade5ec](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/0ade5ec2b4f9b81fcd3a4bbb1672c11b0131a274))\n* validate container provenance calendar instants ([4c7f27f](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/4c7f27f5458742e860100012ecd30253808421e7))\n* **workflows:** qualify release inputs and evidence test modes ([1783c0a](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/1783c0a377615063f3222c1d28f3ab513af4e72f))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* **tooling:** apply local run outcome retention and cleanup rules ([984c4d5](https://github.com/Hexalith/Hexalith.Builds/commit/984c4d50205d00b5238c1cf19e93b232c3282c22))\n"
